#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Copper guided lifecycle entry for an operator-owned Ubuntu host.

Destructive site removal is separated from ordinary uninstall and is only
available after the customer's latest encrypted whole-site backup has been
downloaded, independently verified, and recorded by the server.
"""

